  "description": "SelectPdf Online REST API is a professional solution for managing PDF documents online. \n\nThe API is easy to use and the integration takes only a few lines of code. The generated PDFs are perfect. That makes SelectPdf API the best html to pdf online service that can be used.\n\nSelectPdf HTML To PDF Online REST API is a professional solution that lets you create PDF from web pages and raw HTML code in your applications.\n\nSelectPdf Pdf Merge REST API is an online solution that lets you merge local or remote PDFs into a final PDF document.\n\nSelectPdf Pdf To Text REST API is an online solution that lets you extract text from your PDF documents or search your PDF document for certain words.\n\nSelectPdf can also produce tagged, accessible PDF and target a PDF conformance level - PDF/A for long term archiving, PDF/X for graphics exchange, PDF/SiqQ for digital signatures.\n\nSelectPdf Invoice REST API turns an HTML invoice into a ZUGFeRD / Factur-X hybrid electronic invoice: a single PDF/A-3 file carrying both the human readable invoice and the machine readable XML, for EN 16931, XRECHNUNG and the other supported profiles.",
  "iconFile": "images\\icon.png",
