  "published": "2026-10-07T12:02:11.76Z",
  "readmeFile": "docs\\README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added InvoiceClient for ZUGFeRD / Factur-X hybrid electronic invoices (POST /api2/invoice/): converts a url or html invoice into a PDF/A-3 document with the invoice XML embedded as an associated file. Profiles MINIMUM, BASIC WL, BASIC, EN 16931, EXTENDED and XRECHNUNG, with the attachment relationship derived from the profile when not set, and the embedded file named as the standard requires. Added accessibility and standards support to HtmlToPdfClient: setTagged (tagged, accessible PDF with a logical structure tree - requires the Blink or Chromium engine, and the API promotes the engine automatically when none is set), setPdfStandard (Full, PdfA, PdfA2B, PdfA3A, PdfA3B, PdfA3U, PdfX, PdfSiqQ_A, PdfSiqQ_B) and setDocumentLanguage. Added setWebPageFixedSize (cut the page at the web page height or convert the whole page) and setAuthUsername / setAuthPassword (HTTP Basic authentication on the converted page). In demo mode, async conversions and getWebElements now throw DemoUnsupportedException before sending a request. New enums: PdfStandard, ZugferdProfile, ZugferdRelationship, ZugferdSchema. Refreshed the package icon.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "Generate PDF documents from HTML in .NET using SelectPdf Online REST API using this .NET Client library.",
  "title": ".NET Client for SelectPdf Online REST API",
